Z||000017||Racer 1||11-10-1999||07:33 PM||||actually my battery handles the load well. I have a "ferrid"&lt;---not the right spelling-- cap to take the big amp draws instead of the battery. Kinda like a second small battery. I use to run two batteries back in the day. i had that hot weather starting problem with my 4 cyld ducky engine. I finally got rid of the second battery when I got the ford siliniod starter kit. Now I dont blast my music everytime I drive my fiero and respect people privacy after 8:00 p.m. so I dont play it loud after then. Its like a hobby for me. Thats what I got into in high school and enjoy it. ||||reg||6
